               For the Feast of the Theophany:
            </Language>
         </Comment>

         <Group>
            <Season id="Liturgy">
               <Text>
                  <Language id="Coptic">
                     Vai pe Pihi/b n~te V]: v/etw~li m~v~nobi m~pikocmoc: v/e~tafini n~outap n~cw]: eyrefnohem m~Peflaoc
                  </Language>
