         </Group>
         
         <Text>
            <Language id="Coptic">
               All/louia (4) I/couc Pi,~rictoc p~s/ri m~V]: af[iwmc qen piIordan/c.
            </Language>
            <Language id="English">
               Alleluia (4), Jesus Christ, the Son of God, was baptized in the Jordan.
            </Language>
            <Language id="Arabic">
               الليلويا (4) يسوع المسيح ابن الله اعتمد في الأردن.
            </Language>         
